# Publish product changes to GitHub

When a requested change to this demo is finished and verified, commit it and push `main` so GitHub Pages updates. Do not wait for a separate publish request.

- Remote: `https://github.com/amirhosseinjahani88-code/jahanicoaching.git`
- Public site: `https://amirhosseinjahani88-code.github.io/jahanicoaching/`
- Never commit `ai-key.local.txt`, `.env`, or API keys.
- The public site calls the Cloudflare Worker proxy. Never put the AvalAI key in the repo or in `config.js`; it stays a Worker secret and in `ai-key.local.txt`.
- Do not force-push.
